Bedroom city ambience mixes excerpts from these CC0-1.0 field recordings:

Closed-window traffic by conleec https://freesound.org/people/conleec/sounds/149428/
Brooklyn car horn 01 by Brett+Butter https://freesound.org/people/Brett%2BButter/sounds/553150/
Brooklyn car horn 02 by Brett+Butter https://freesound.org/people/Brett%2BButter/sounds/553149/
Manhattan street traffic by allanh15 https://freesound.org/people/allanh15/sounds/353180/
Apartment birds by njlyczko https://freesound.org/people/njlyczko/sounds/580646/

Codex assisted with selecting excerpts, filtering, and mixing the recordings.
